request_description:
·        Correspondence regarding concerns at the poor response to significant internal control weaknesses within Cork City Council;
·        All correspondence or contacts with the Internal Audit division at Cork City council relating to the preparation of the LGAS audit of Cork City Council;
·        A copy of all files, notes or briefs available to or relied on by LGAS in preparation of the correspondence.​

​All correspondence relating to notifications made by the Department of the Environment, Community and Local Government to the EU concerning:
IS EN 13242: 2002;
National Roads Authority Manual of Contract Documents for Roadworks;
Clause 804 - Granular Material Type B;
Issues concerning the presence of pyrite in aggregates.

​(a) All correspondence between the Department and local authorities regarding the maintenance and inspection of septic tanks;
(b) All complaints recorded by the Department regarding pollution caused by septic tanks in 2011, including all complaints, correspondence with European Commission regarding the inspection of septic tanks in Ireland; and
(c) Any internal reports on the cost of the roll out of the septic tank registration and inspection system.
